    "answer": {
      "short": "Romaine earns the most.",
      "worked": "Compare annual earnings using 52 weeks, 26 fortnights and 12 months per year.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Harriet's weekly pay} &= \\$32.85\\times28=\\$919.80\\\\\n\\text{Harriet's annual pay} &= \\$919.80\\times52=\\$47\\,829.60\\\\\n\\text{Edith's annual pay} &= \\$1838\\times26=\\$47\\,788\\\\\n\\text{Romaine's annual pay} &= \\$935\\times52=\\$48\\,620\\\\\n\\text{Trinity's annual pay} &= \\$4050\\times12=\\$48\\,600\n\\end{align*}$$\nRomaine earns the most: \\$48 620 per year.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 48
